  "body": "Enjoy easy coastal living at Saltwood in this well-designed three-bedroom townhouse, with quality finishes and a practical, low-maintenance layout.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor features an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area with plenty of natural light and direct access to your own private courtyard. The kitchen includes stone benchtops, quality appliances and good storage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master bedroom includes a private ensuite. Two further bedrooms provide flexibility for family, guests or working from home, along with a well-appointed main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe landscaped courtyard provides a private outdoor space to relax or entertain, while the internal-access garage adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nSet close to Red Beach, parks, cafés, shops and schools, Saltwood is an ideal choice for easy, modern coastal living.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n3 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\nInternal-access garage\r\nWindow furnishings included\r\nOpen-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\nDesigner kitchen with stone benchtops and quality appliances\r\nPrivate courtyard\r\nMaster bedroom with ensuitey\r\nQuality finishes and fixtures throughout\r\nClose to Red Beach, parks, cafés, shops and schools\r\n\r\nSelected images have been digitally styled to illustrate how the spaces can be furnished and enjoyed.",
